{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在上半屏左侧第一段的大号白字和紫色强调词“忘了藏好喜欢”；紧接着容易被第二段同样醒目的“心里空落落的”“会嫌自己太黏”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"大致抓到他这次没藏住喜欢，被对方看出了自己有多在乎；具体前后关系和处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"空落落、担心被嫌太黏。\",\n  \"missed\": \"前几次他想说又收住，对方却始终亲近；这次被看出在乎后，他不知道怎么相处，感觉亲近隔了一层。以及他对这份幸福是否真实的疑问。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两段字号相近、都很醒目的大字先后争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块：第一段交代被看出喜欢的处境，第二段交代空落落和害怕被嫌弃的感受，需要拼接才能理解两者关系。\",\n    \"单块长句包含多层转折和关系信息，仅看紫色放大词不足以直接还原完整处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "844321ad-2b9a-470d-9229-ca0beedb5909", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T011020699229Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:10:41.108354+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f4a0ddb01e07840436d87294181f41f7c5f2c5431c398feafcf7d8fa2be50e06", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995